<p>A SERIES II SLOT</p>
<div style="text-align: center;">
<p><span style="font-size:200%;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><em><strong>AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA</strong></em></span></span></p>
</div>
<p>Super special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3440103); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3440103&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1548003125" alt="Captain Kirby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3440103)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3440103); return false;">Captain Kirby</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/varaxous" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2433554); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2433554&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1548003125" alt="Varaxous" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2433554)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/varaxous" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2433554); return false;">Varaxous</a></span>, and <em>especially</em> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/billith" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3042342); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3042342&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1548003125" alt="Billith" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3042342)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/billith" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3042342); return false;">Billith</a></span> for looking this over. Specifically, Billith did like 90% of the technical jargon that makes it sound cool. If he asked this to be considered co-authored, I would make it so in a heart beat, because he practically rewrote the description and containment procedures. (Open invitation, Billith)</p>
<p>This was really fun to write! It clocks under 3,000 words, so despite having a four part addendum, it still meets my head requirements for a good short article. The containment procedures and the description both fit fully on screen at the same time, so I am really happy about that. I intentionally made no mention of GAW, though you may choose to headcanon this however you choose. I also intentionally made Jamie gender neutral, so you may headcanon that as well. Hopefully this is a compelling enough story. Cheers!</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Now that it is entirely co-authored, the credits:</span><br />
<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/billith" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3042342); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3042342&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1548003125" alt="Billith" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3042342)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/billith" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3042342); return false;">Billith</a></span> &#8212; Wrote the containment procedures, and the description, did tons of small edits.<br />
<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1581620); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1548003125" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1581620); return false;">DarkStuff</a></span> &#8212; Wrote the story and the original drafts, addenda remain mostly of his design (though as has been stated, Billith did <em>tons</em> of small edits)</p>
